From: chatgptyukkuri <chatgptyukkuri@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 11:59:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/14] vkd3d-shader/fx: Support matrix expressions in fx_2_0
 state assignments.

Matrices are written in row-major order, which is the layout of the matrix
values of the states. The rows or columns of matrix inputs use separate
registers, depending on their majority.

Constant indices of vectors and matrices are supported as well.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
